@startuml sequence-certification-path
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
title Sequence: Follow Certification Path

actor Student
participant "CertificationDetail\nActivity" as Cert
participant "OpenAIService" as API
participant "AI Engine" as AI
participant "ModuleActivity" as Module
participant "QuizActivity" as Quiz
participant "Firestore" as DB

Student -> Cert : open certification
Cert -> DB : load progress
DB --> Cert : saved progress (or empty)
Cert -> API : getChatCompletion(modules prompt)
API -> AI : generate modules
AI --> API : JSON modules
API --> Cert : OpenAIResponse
Cert -> Cert : parse & show modules
Student -> Cert : select a module
Cert -> Module : open module
Student -> Module : study content
Module -> Quiz : start quiz
Student -> Quiz : answer questions
Quiz -> Quiz : score (>= 70% = pass)
Quiz --> Cert : quiz result
Cert -> DB : save progress
DB --> Cert : saved
Cert --> Student : unlock next module\n(or earn certificate)

@enduml
